                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<h2>Get smoker surveillance</h2><p>Are you chained to your smoker like it’s a needy pet? Sick of squinting at cloudy dials that move slower than a turtle in molasses? </p><p>Well, polish your tongs and fire up your coals, because the <strong>Giant Grill Gauge</strong> is about to change the game.</p><p>DOES IT...</p><p><strong>Measure up to 1000 °F? </strong>You bet your acetylene torch it does.</p><p><strong>Have a removable display?</strong> Yup, held on to the Heat Shield by magnets.</p><p><strong>Connect directly to WiFi?</strong> You betcha.</p><p><strong>Work natively with your Predictive Thermometer?</strong> Of course! And it also flies solo. </p><p><strong>Control the temperature? </strong>Absolutely—with the new Combustion Engine.</p>",
                    "width": "fit-content",
